track dcCAGEseqComposite
shortLabel DC CAGE-seq
longLabel DANIO-CODE CAGE-seq signal and tag clusters by developmental stage
type bed 3
visibility hide
filterComposite dimA dimB dimC
dimensions dimX=stage dimA=kind dimB=sample dimC=enstage
sortOrder enstage=+ sample=+ kind=-
subGroup1 view Views regions=regions signal=signal
